{
  "info": {
    "name": "LAVO — Admin API",
    "description": "Collection pour les endpoints d'administration LAVO.\n\nVariable requise : `base_url` (ex: http://localhost:3000)\nVariable requise : `access_token` (JWT admin, obtenu après login admin)\nVariable requise : `station_id` (UUID de la station ciblée)\nVariable requise : `user_id` (UUID de l'utilisateur ciblé)\n\n## Groupes\n- **Admin — Stations** : lister (paginé), détailler, approuver, rejeter, modifier les stations\n- **Admin — Users** : modifier les informations, débloquer un compte utilisateur",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "station_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Admin — Stations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Lister stations en attente (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Retourne stations paginées', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('stations');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('meta');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.meta).to.have.property('total');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.meta).to.have.property('page');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.meta).to.have.property('per_page');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.meta).to.have.property('total_pages');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.stations).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/stations?page=1&per_page=20",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "admin",
                "stations"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "per_page",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Authentifie admin. Retourne les stations avec status=pending_admin_validation.\n\nPagination : `page` (defaut: 1), `per_page` (defaut: 20, max: 100).\nReponse : `{ data: { stations: [...], meta: { total, page, per_page, total_pages } } }`"
          }
        },
